# CR 601.2h: a two-colour hybrid shard ({W/U}) resolves to whichever colour
# the controller chooses -- ChooseHybridManaColor, manapay.go -- not a fixed
# order. Only blue is in the pool, so the answer has to be blue for the
# payment to succeed.
# Main phase of turn 1, so the payment is made at a priority (L2 S19).
startturn human
advance 3
queue hybridmanacolor U
paymanacost human W/U
